<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-3xl" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
    <p class="ws-index ws-ink">03 · Fade, scale, blur</p>
    <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="p3_title">More channels, same grammar.</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="p3_lead">Opacity, scale and blur each take a from,to pair too, and they combine on one element. Blur costs the most to draw, so use it sparingly.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">

<div data-sw-parallax-opacity="0.1,1" class="rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-secondary p-8 font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white">Fades in as it rises</div>
<div data-sw-parallax-scale="0.85,1.05" class="rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-secondary p-8 font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white">Grows as it rises</div>
<div data-sw-parallax-blur="8,0" class="rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-secondary p-8 font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white">Comes into focus</div>

  </div>
  <div class="mt-6">
<div class="ws-window overflow-hidden rounded-2xl">
  <div class="ws-dots flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-3"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="ml-3 font-code text-xs text-white/50">parallax · opacity, scale, blur</span></div>
<pre class="overflow-x-auto"><code><span class="tk-tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-parallax-opacity</span>=<span class="tk-str">"0.1,1"</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-secondary p-8 font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>Fades in as it rises<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
<span class="tk-tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-parallax-scale</span>=<span class="tk-str">"0.85,1.05"</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-secondary p-8 font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>Grows as it rises<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
<span class="tk-tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-parallax-blur</span>=<span class="tk-str">"8,0"</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-secondary p-8 font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>Comes into focus<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span></code></pre>
</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-y border-base-content/10 bg-base-200/50">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
      <p class="ws-index ws-ink">04 · Windows</p>
      <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="p4_title">Finish in the middle, then leave.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="p4_lead">An effect runs over the whole pass by default, so it peaks as the element leaves the top. A window of <code class="font-code text-base">0,0.5</code> finishes it when the element is centred. The rest of the pass is then free for an <code class="font-code text-base">-out</code> phase: in, hold, out.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">

<div data-sw-parallax-opacity="0,1" data-sw-parallax-opacity-range="0,0.5" class="rounded-3xl bg-neutral p-8 font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white">Fully visible by the centre</div>
<div data-sw-parallax-opacity="0,1" data-sw-parallax-opacity-range="0,0.5" data-sw-parallax-opacity-out="1,0" data-sw-parallax-scale="0.9,1" data-sw-parallax-scale-range="0,0.5" data-sw-parallax-scale-out="1,0.9" class="rounded-3xl bg-neutral p-8 font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white">In to the centre, then back out</div>

    </div>
    <div class="mt-6">
<div class="ws-window overflow-hidden rounded-2xl">
  <div class="ws-dots flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-3"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="ml-3 font-code text-xs text-white/50">parallax · windows</span></div>
<pre class="overflow-x-auto"><code><span class="tk-tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-parallax-opacity</span>=<span class="tk-str">"0,1"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-parallax-opacity-range</span>=<span class="tk-str">"0,0.5"</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"rounded-3xl bg-neutral p-8 font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>Fully visible by the centre<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
<span class="tk-tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-parallax-opacity</span>=<span class="tk-str">"0,1"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-parallax-opacity-range</span>=<span class="tk-str">"0,0.5"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-parallax-opacity-out</span>=<span class="tk-str">"1,0"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-parallax-scale</span>=<span class="tk-str">"0.9,1"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-parallax-scale-range</span>=<span class="tk-str">"0,0.5"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-parallax-scale-out</span>=<span class="tk-str">"1,0.9"</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"rounded-3xl bg-neutral p-8 font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>In to the centre, then back out<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span></code></pre>
</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
      {{sw-icon "person-simple" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}
      <h3 class="mt-4 font-heading text-lg font-bold">Reduced motion</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">For visitors who ask for less motion the runtime does nothing at all, and every element sits where the layout put it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="80">
      {{sw-icon "layout" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}
      <h3 class="mt-4 font-heading text-lg font-bold">Never moves the layout</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">The runtime only adds a transform, an opacity or a filter. Without JavaScript nothing shifts, overlaps or disappears.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="160">
      {{sw-icon "sliders-horizontal" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}
      <h3 class="mt-4 font-heading text-lg font-bold">A builder in the editor</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">The editor's Library has a Parallax builder that writes these attributes for you, with a live preview.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-t border-base-content/10 bg-base-200/50">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
      <h2 class="ws-display text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">More of the showcase</h2>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="{{sw-url '/showcase'}}">All demos {{sw-icon "arrow-right" "h-4 w-4"}}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {{#each pages.showcase._attributes.children}}
      {{#unless (eq path @root.page.path)}}
      <a class="ws-tile rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-4" href="{{sw-url path}}">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-heading font-semibold">{{#if data.icon}}{{sw-icon data.icon "h-4 w-4 ws-ink"}}{{/if}}{{title}}</span>
      </a>
      {{/unless}}
      {{/each}}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
